{"id": "EUVD-2026-107671", "enisaUuid": "7ff56154-35d2-3918-bd31-e82f8f53fc28", "description": "GitLab has remediated an issue in GitLab CE/EE affecting all versions from 18.3 before 19.3.6, 19.4 before 19.4.3, and 19.5 before 19.5.1 that, under certain conditions, an unauthenticated user could have poisoned a shared cache's OAuth/OIDC discovery document to redirect certain flows to an externally controlled server, due to improper trust of user-supplied values when constructing endpoint URLs in cached discovery responses.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T23:33:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T23:33:45", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:L/A:L", "references": ["https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/work_items/627499", "https://docs.gitlab.com/releases/patches/patch-release-gitlab-19-5-1-released/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112212", "GHSA-f887-chxw-8674"], "assigner": "GitLab", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3fd99597-41cc-3041-92dd-0eb1c1422868", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "19.4 <19.4.3"}, {"id": "953c3865-ecfb-322e-866a-49234a1dffe8", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "18.3 <19.3.6"}, {"id": "a7dafe38-012e-3668-b859-d0685d8f5649", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "19.5 <19.5.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "20184eec-5b60-3769-bfdc-204e9f195578", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}], "isExploited": false}